# California Multiple Award Schedule (CMAS) Program

### The State of California establishes multiple award agreements–awards given to two or more contractors for the same products and/or services at the same or similar prices.

The Schedule Contract experts at DKA can assist with obtaining and maintaining your CMAS Schedule contract.

### Over 500 GSA Schedules Awarded.

We’ve assisted more than 500 companies list and maintain their products and services on the GSA Schedule.

### DKA adds substantial value to its Schedule clients.

Once your company is on a Schedule Contract, DKA can help you find contracts to pursue and help you successfully prepare and submit your proposals. Our Schedule services include contract and proposal assistance, maintenance and more.

[Get Started Today](#contact)

